Requires Python packages markdown, python-pptx, Pillow, pypdf; Node.js,
the repository's ws package, Chromium, and a local Mermaid 11.4.1 bundle.
Example:
  PYTHONPATH=/tmp/submalink-slides-tools/python python3 build.py \
    --mermaid-js /tmp/submalink-slides-tools/mermaid.min.js

The original Markdown and logo are read only. Outputs embed the logo.
"""
